---
import SectionWrapper from '../ui/SectionWrapper.astro';
---

<SectionWrapper>
  <section class="container content-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">OVERVIEW</p>
      <h2>Education, learning systems, and practical application</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
      <p>E Deviser supports education-focused innovation by aligning product thinking, systems design, and learning context. Cuevo is part of this direction.</p>
      <p>Use this page to orient visitors and provide a clear external destination for the product site.</p>
      <p><a class="external-link" href="https://cuovo.tech" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit Cuevo.tech</a> to view the external destination.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SectionWrapper>
